.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt RAVEN-VERSION 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm raven-version
.Nd print RavenBSD client version information
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the version of the
.Xr raven 1
client.
With
.Fl -json
it emits one object of
.Va kind :
.Dq version
with these fields:
.Bl -tag -width "schema_version"
.It Va schema
The contract schema, 1.
.It Va kind
.Dq version .
.It Va version
The client version.
.It Va schema_version
The output schema version, 1.
.It Va target
The build target triple, for example
.Dq x86_64-unknown-ravenbsd .
.It Va build
The build identifier.
.Dv null
until the target build provides one.
.It Va boot_id
The running boot identifier.
.Dv null
until the target provides one.
.El
.Pp
The target may provide the two null fields in a later ticket; this command never invents them.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr raven 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD modern userland contract, revision 1.
